08:48:49,000 --> 08:49:34,000
this is a tale of sorrow a love denied a love restored to live beyond tomorrow . last we think silence is the place to hide a heavy heart,remember to love and be loved is life itself with which we are nought.[中规中矩吧，毕竟是费叔自导自演]

